'''Secluded Springs''' (Japanese: '''{{j|未知なる水域}}''' ''Unknown Waters'') is the sixth themed booster pack, and the tenth expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Secluded Springs''' is the sixth themed booster pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion acts as a follow-up to the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion, which focused on [[Generation II]], and focuses on {{p|Raikou}}, {{p|Entei}}, and {{p|Suicune}}—the [[legendary beasts]] of the [[Johto]] region—as {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}}. It also features {{p|Latias}} and {{p|Latios}}, the [[Eon duo|Eon Pokémon]].

