== Offering rates ==
The following table outlines the offering rates for the Secluded Springs booster pack.

The probability of each type of pack appearing is as it follows:
* Regular pack - 91.620%
* Regular pack + 1 card - 8.330%
* Rare pack - 0.050%

In regular packs with a bonus card, the card inclusion rates for the first five cards are the same as those for regular packs without a bonus card.

{{TCG ID|Secluded Springs|Mantyke|23}} (#023), {{TCG ID|Secluded Springs|Igglybuff|59}} (#059), {{TCG ID|Secluded Springs|Azurill|63}} (#063) and {{TCG ID|Secluded Springs|Azurill|77}} (#077) are only available as bonus cards.

